\h Micah
\toc1 Micah
\p
\rem From here on, this file is autogenerated by bibmark. You may edit the header section, as it will not be changed by bibmark.

\c 1
\p 
\v 1 \w The word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w that came to Micah| strong="H4318" \w* \w the Morasthite| strong="H4183" \w* \w in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Jotham| strong="H3147" \w*, \w Ahaz| strong="H271" \w*, and \w Hezekiah| strong="H3169" \w*, \w kings| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [which he saw]{strong=“H2372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w concerning Samaria| strong="H8111" \w* \w and Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*. 
\v 2 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \w all ye people| strong="H5971" \w*; [hearken]{strong=“H7181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, \w O earth| strong="H776" \w*, \w and all that therein| strong="H4393" \w* [is: and let the Lord]{strong=“H136”} \sc God\sc* \w be witness| strong="H5707" \w* [against you, the Lord]{strong=“H136”} \w from his holy| strong="H6944" \w* \w temple| strong="H1964" \w*.\f + \fr 1:2 \ft all ye…: Heb. ye people, all of them \f* \f + \fr 1:2 \ft all that…: Heb. the fulness thereof \f* 
\v 3 For, behold, the \sc Lord\sc* [cometh forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w out of his place| strong="H4725" \w*, [and will come down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and tread]{strong=“H1869” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w upon the high places| strong="H1116" \w* \w of the earth| strong="H776" \w*. 
\v 4 \w And the mountains| strong="H2022" \w* [shall be molten]{strong=“H4549” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [under him, and the valleys]{strong=“H6010”} [shall be cleft]{strong=“H1234” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”}, \w as wax| strong="H1749" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w the fire| strong="H784" \w*, and \w as the waters| strong="H4325" \w* that are [poured]{strong=“H5064” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8716”} \w down a steep place| strong="H4174" \w*.\f + \fr 1:4 \ft a steep…: Heb. a descent \f* 
\v 5 \w For the transgression| strong="H6588" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* is [all this, and for the sins]{strong=“H2403”} \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. What is \w the transgression| strong="H6588" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*? is it \w not Samaria| strong="H8111" \w*? and what are \w the high places| strong="H1116" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*? are they \w not Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*? 
\v 6 [Therefore I will make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Samaria| strong="H8111" \w* \w as an heap| strong="H5856" \w* \w of the field| strong="H7704" \w*, and \w as plantings| strong="H4302" \w* \w of a vineyard| strong="H3754" \w*: [and I will pour down]{strong=“H5064” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the stones| strong="H68" \w* \w thereof into the valley| strong="H1516" \w*, [and I will discover]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the foundations| strong="H3247" \w* thereof. 
\v 7 \w And all the graven images| strong="H6456" \w* [thereof shall be beaten to pieces]{strong=“H3807” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8714”}, \w and all the hires| strong="H868" \w* [thereof shall be burned]{strong=“H8313” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w with the fire| strong="H784" \w*, \w and all the idols| strong="H6091" \w* [thereof will I lay]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w desolate| strong="H8077" \w*: [for she gathered]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} it \w of the hire| strong="H868" \w* [of an harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and they shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the hire| strong="H868" \w* [of an harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\p
\v 8 [Therefore I will wail]{strong=“H5594” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and howl]{strong=“H3213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [I will go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [stripped]{strong=“H7758 H7758” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675”} \w and naked| strong="H6174" \w*: [I will make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a wailing| strong="H4553" \w* \w like the dragons| strong="H8577" \w*, \w and mourning| strong="H60" \w* [as the owls]{strong=“H3284 H1323”}.\f + \fr 1:8 \ft owls: Heb. daughters of the owl \f* 
\v 9 \w For her wound| strong="H4347" \w* is [incurable]{strong=“H605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}; [for it is come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto Judah| strong="H3063" \w*; [he is come]{strong=“H5060” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*, even \w to Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*.\f + \fr 1:9 \ft her…: or, she is grievously sick of her wounds \f* 
\p
\v 10 [Declare]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} ye it \w not at Gath| strong="H1661" \w*, [weep]{strong=“H1058” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [ye not at all]{strong=“H1058” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: \w in the house of Aphrah| strong="H1036" \w* [roll]{strong=“H6428 H6428” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8694 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8690”} \w thyself in the dust| strong="H6083" \w*.\f + \fr 1:10 \ft Aphrah: that is, Dust \f* 
\v 11 [Pass ye away]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [thou inhabitant]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Saphir| strong="H8208" \w*, \w having thy shame| strong="H1322" \w* \w naked| strong="H6181" \w*: [the inhabitant]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Zaanan| strong="H6630" \w* [came not forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the mourning| strong="H4553" \w* [of Beth-ezel]{strong=“H1018”}; [he shall receive]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of you his standing| strong="H5979" \w*.\f + \fr 1:11 \ft thou…: or, thou that dwellest fairly \f* \f + \fr 1:11 \ft inhabitant: Heb. inhabitress \f* \f + \fr 1:11 \ft Zaanan: or, The country of flocks \f* \f + \fr 1:11 \ft Beth-ezel: or, A place near \f* 
\v 12 [For the inhabitant]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Maroth| strong="H4796" \w* [waited carefully]{strong=“H2342” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w for good| strong="H2896" \w*: \w but evil| strong="H7451" \w* [came down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} from the \sc Lord\sc* \w unto the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w of Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*.\f + \fr 1:12 \ft inhabitant: Heb. inhabitress \f* \f + \fr 1:12 \ft waited…: or, was grieved \f* 
\v 13 [O thou inhabitant]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Lachish| strong="H3923" \w*, [bind]{strong=“H7573” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the chariot| strong="H4818" \w* \w to the swift beast| strong="H7409" \w*: she is \w the beginning| strong="H7225" \w* \w of the sin| strong="H2403" \w* \w to the daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of Zion| strong="H6726" \w*: \w for the transgressions| strong="H6588" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [were found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} in thee.\f + \fr 1:13 \ft inhabitant: Heb. inhabitress \f* 
\v 14 [Therefore shalt thou give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w presents| strong="H7964" \w* [to Moresheth-gath]{strong=“H4182”}: \w the houses| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Achzib| strong="H392" \w* shall be \w a lie| strong="H391" \w* \w to the kings| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.\f + \fr 1:14 \ft to…: or, for Moresheth-gath \f* \f + \fr 1:14 \ft Achzib: that is, A lie \f* 
\v 15 [Yet will I bring]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [an heir]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [unto thee, O inhabitant]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Mareshah| strong="H4762" \w*: [he shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Adullam| strong="H5725" \w* \w the glory| strong="H3519" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.\f + \fr 1:15 \ft inhabitant: Heb. inhabitress \f* \f + \fr 1:15 \ft he…: or, the glory of Israel shall, etc \f* 
\v 16 [Make thee bald]{strong=“H7139” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [and poll]{strong=“H1494” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thee for thy delicate| strong="H8588" \w* \w children| strong="H1121" \w*; [enlarge]{strong=“H7337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w thy baldness| strong="H7144" \w* \w as the eagle| strong="H5404" \w*; [for they are gone into captivity]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} from thee.
\c 2
\p 
\v 1 \w Woe| strong="H1945" \w* [to them that devise]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w iniquity| strong="H205" \w*, [and work]{strong=“H6466” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w evil| strong="H7451" \w* \w upon their beds| strong="H4904" \w*! \w when the morning| strong="H1242" \w* \w is light| strong="H216" \w*, [they practise]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [it, because it is]{strong=“H3426”} \w in the power| strong="H410" \w* \w of their hand| strong="H3027" \w*. 
\v 2 [And they covet]{strong=“H2530” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w fields| strong="H7704" \w*, and take them [by violence]{strong=“H1497” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w and houses| strong="H1004" \w*, and take them [away]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [so they oppress]{strong=“H6231” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w a man| strong="H1397" \w* \w and his house| strong="H1004" \w*, \w even a man| strong="H376" \w* \w and his heritage| strong="H5159" \w*.\f + \fr 2:2 \ft oppress: or, defraud \f* 
\v 3 [Therefore thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*; [Behold, against this family]{strong=“H4940”} [do I devise]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w an evil| strong="H7451" \w*, [from which ye shall not remove]{strong=“H4185” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w your necks| strong="H6677" \w*; [neither shall ye go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w haughtily| strong="H7317" \w*: \w for this time| strong="H6256" \w* is \w evil| strong="H7451" \w*. 
\p
\v 4 \w In that day| strong="H3117" \w* shall one [take up]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a parable| strong="H4912" \w* [against you, and lament]{strong=“H5091” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with a doleful| strong="H5093" \w* \w lamentation| strong="H5092" \w*, and [say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [We be utterly]{strong=“H7703” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [spoiled]{strong=“H7703” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}: [he hath changed]{strong=“H4171” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the portion| strong="H2506" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*: [how hath he removed]{strong=“H4185” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} it [from me! turning away]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8788”} [he hath divided]{strong=“H2505” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w our fields| strong="H7704" \w*.\f + \fr 2:4 \ft a doleful…: Heb. a lamentation of lamentations \f* \f + \fr 2:4 \ft turning…: or, instead of restoring \f* 
\v 5 [Therefore thou shalt have none that shall cast]{strong=“H7993” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w a cord| strong="H2256" \w* \w by lot| strong="H1486" \w* \w in the congregation| strong="H6951" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\p
\v 6 [Prophesy]{strong=“H5197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} ye not, say they to them that [prophesy]{strong=“H5197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}: [they shall not prophesy]{strong=“H5197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} to them, that [they shall not take]{strong=“H5253” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w shame| strong="H3639" \w*.\f + \fr 2:6 \ft Prophesy ye…: or, Prophesy not as they prophesy: Heb. Drop, etc \f* 
\p
\v 7 O thou that art [named]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, \w is the spirit| strong="H7307" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [straitened]{strong=“H7114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}? are \w these his doings| strong="H4611" \w*? \w do not my words| strong="H1697" \w* [do good]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [to him that walketh]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w uprightly| strong="H3477" \w*?\f + \fr 2:7 \ft straitened: or, shortened? \f* \f + \fr 2:7 \ft uprightly: Heb. upright? \f* 
\v 8 \w Even of late| strong="H865" \w* \w my people| strong="H5971" \w* [is risen up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8787”} [as an enemy]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: [ye pull off]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the robe| strong="H145" \w* \w with| strong="H4136" \w* \w the garment| strong="H8008" \w* [from them that pass]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w by securely| strong="H983" \w* [as men averse]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w from war| strong="H4421" \w*.\f + \fr 2:8 \ft of late: Heb. yesterday \f* \f + \fr 2:8 \ft with the: Heb. over against a \f* 
\v 9 \w The women| strong="H802" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w* [have ye cast out]{strong=“H1644” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w from their pleasant| strong="H8588" \w* \w houses| strong="H1004" \w*; \w from their children| strong="H5768" \w* [have ye taken away]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my glory| strong="H1926" \w* \w for ever| strong="H5769" \w*.\f + \fr 2:9 \ft women: or, wives \f* 
\v 10 [Arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [ye, and depart]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}; for this is not your \w rest| strong="H4496" \w*: [because it is polluted]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [it shall destroy]{strong=“H2254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} you, [even with a sore]{strong=“H4834” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w destruction| strong="H2256" \w*. 
\v 11 \w If| strong="H3863" \w* \w a man| strong="H376" \w* [walking]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the spirit| strong="H7307" \w* \w and falsehood| strong="H8267" \w* [do lie]{strong=“H3576” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}, saying, [I will prophesy]{strong=“H5197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w unto thee of wine| strong="H3196" \w* \w and of strong drink| strong="H7941" \w*; [he shall even be the prophet]{strong=“H5197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w of this people| strong="H5971" \w*.\f + \fr 2:11 \ft walking…: or, walk with the wind, and lie falsely \f* 
\p
\v 12 [I will surely]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [assemble]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w O Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, [all of thee; I will surely]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} [gather]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the remnant| strong="H7611" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [I will put]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w them together| strong="H3162" \w* \w as the sheep| strong="H6629" \w* [of Bozrah]{strong=“H1224 H1223” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8677”}, \w as the flock| strong="H5739" \w* \w in the midst| strong="H8432" \w* \w of their fold| strong="H1699" \w*: [they shall make great noise]{strong=“H1949” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} by reason of the multitude of \w men| strong="H120" \w*. 
\v 13 [The breaker]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [is come up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [them: they have broken up]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and have passed through]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the gate| strong="H8179" \w*, [and are gone out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [by it: and their king]{strong=“H4428”} [shall pass]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* them, and the \sc Lord\sc* \w on the head| strong="H7218" \w* of them. 
\c 3
\p 
\v 1 [And I said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [I pray you, O heads]{strong=“H7218”} \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, \w and ye princes| strong="H7101" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; Is it [not for you to know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w judgment| strong="H4941" \w*? 
\v 2 [Who hate]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the good| strong="H2896" \w*, [and love]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the evil| strong="H7451" \w*; [who pluck off]{strong=“H1497” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w their skin| strong="H5785" \w* [from off them, and their flesh]{strong=“H7607”} \w from off their bones| strong="H6106" \w*; 
\v 3 [Who also eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the flesh| strong="H7607" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*, [and flay]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w their skin| strong="H5785" \w* [from off them; and they break]{strong=“H6476” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w their bones| strong="H6106" \w*, [and chop them in pieces]{strong=“H6566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w as for the pot| strong="H5518" \w*, \w and as flesh| strong="H1320" \w* \w within| strong="H8432" \w* \w the caldron| strong="H7037" \w*. 
\v 4 [Then shall they cry]{strong=“H2199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*, [but he will not hear]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them: he will even hide]{strong=“H5641” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w his face| strong="H6440" \w* \w from them at that time| strong="H6256" \w*, [as they have behaved themselves ill]{strong=“H7489” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w in their doings| strong="H4611" \w*. 
\p
\v 5 [Thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w concerning the prophets| strong="H5030" \w* \w that make my people| strong="H5971" \w* [err]{strong=“H8582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}, [that bite]{strong=“H5391” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w with their teeth| strong="H8127" \w*, [and cry]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w Peace| strong="H7965" \w*; [and he that putteth]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not into their mouths| strong="H6310" \w*, [they even prepare]{strong=“H6942” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w war| strong="H4421" \w* against him. 
\v 6 \w Therefore night| strong="H3915" \w* shall be [unto you, that ye shall not have a vision]{strong=“H2377”}; [and it shall be dark]{strong=“H2821 H2821” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675”} [unto you, that ye shall not divine]{strong=“H7080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}; \w and the sun| strong="H8121" \w* [shall go down]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w over the prophets| strong="H5030" \w*, \w and the day| strong="H3117" \w* [shall be dark]{strong=“H6937” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} over them.\f + \fr 3:6 \ft that…: vision: Heb. from a vision \f* \f + \fr 3:6 \ft that…: divine: Heb. from divining \f* 
\v 7 \w Then shall the seers| strong="H2374" \w* [be ashamed]{strong=“H954” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and the diviners]{strong=“H7080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [confounded]{strong=“H2659” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [yea, they shall all cover]{strong=“H5844” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w their lips| strong="H8222" \w*; for there is \w no answer| strong="H4617" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*.\f + \fr 3:7 \ft lips: Heb. upper lip \f* 
\p
\v 8 \w But truly| strong="H199" \w* [I am full]{strong=“H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w of power| strong="H3581" \w* \w by the spirit| strong="H7307" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w and of judgment| strong="H4941" \w*, \w and of might| strong="H1369" \w*, [to declare]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w unto Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* \w his transgression| strong="H6588" \w*, \w and to Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w his sin| strong="H2403" \w*. 
\v 9 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [this, I pray you, ye heads]{strong=“H7218”} \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, \w and princes| strong="H7101" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [that abhor]{strong=“H8581” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w judgment| strong="H4941" \w*, [and pervert]{strong=“H6140” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w all equity| strong="H3477" \w*. 
\v 10 [They build up]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w Zion| strong="H6726" \w* \w with blood| strong="H1818" \w*, \w and Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w* \w with iniquity| strong="H5766" \w*.\f + \fr 3:10 \ft blood: Heb. bloods \f* 
\v 11 \w The heads| strong="H7218" \w* [thereof judge]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for reward| strong="H7810" \w*, \w and the priests| strong="H3548" \w* [thereof teach]{strong=“H3384” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w for hire| strong="H4242" \w*, \w and the prophets| strong="H5030" \w* [thereof divine]{strong=“H7080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for money| strong="H3701" \w*: [yet will they lean]{strong=“H8172” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} upon the \sc Lord\sc*, [and say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, Is not the \sc Lord\sc* \w among| strong="H7130" \w* [us? none evil]{strong=“H7451”} [can come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} upon us.\f + \fr 3:11 \ft and say: Heb. saying \f* 
\v 12 \w Therefore shall Zion| strong="H6726" \w* \w for your sake| strong="H1558" \w* [be plowed]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} as \w a field| strong="H7704" \w*, \w and Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w* \w shall become heaps| strong="H5856" \w*, \w and the mountain| strong="H2022" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w as the high places| strong="H1116" \w* \w of the forest| strong="H3293" \w*.
\c 4
\p 
\v 1 \w But in the last| strong="H319" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w* it shall come to pass, that \w the mountain| strong="H2022" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [shall be established]{strong=“H3559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w in the top| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the mountains| strong="H2022" \w*, [and it shall be exalted]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w above the hills| strong="H1389" \w*; \w and people| strong="H5971" \w* [shall flow]{strong=“H5102” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} unto it. 
\v 2 \w And many| strong="H7227" \w* \w nations| strong="H1471" \w* [shall come]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [Come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [and let us go up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the mountain| strong="H2022" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w and to the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of the God| strong="H430" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*; [and he will teach]{strong=“H3384” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w us of his ways| strong="H1870" \w*, [and we will walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in his paths| strong="H734" \w*: \w for the law| strong="H8451" \w* [shall go forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of Zion| strong="H6726" \w*, \w and the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w from Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*. 
\p
\v 3 [And he shall judge]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w among many| strong="H7227" \w* \w people| strong="H5971" \w*, [and rebuke]{strong=“H3198” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w strong| strong="H6099" \w* \w nations| strong="H1471" \w* \w afar off| strong="H7350" \w*; [and they shall beat]{strong=“H3807” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w their swords| strong="H2719" \w* \w into plowshares| strong="H855" \w*, \w and their spears| strong="H2595" \w* \w into pruninghooks| strong="H4211" \w*: \w nation| strong="H1471" \w* [shall not lift up]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a sword| strong="H2719" \w* \w against nation| strong="H1471" \w*, [neither shall they learn]{strong=“H3925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w war| strong="H4421" \w* any more.\f + \fr 4:3 \ft pruninghooks: or, scythes \f* 
\v 4 [But they shall sit]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w every man| strong="H376" \w* \w under his vine| strong="H1612" \w* \w and under his fig tree| strong="H8384" \w*; and none shall make them [afraid]{strong=“H2729” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}: \w for the mouth| strong="H6310" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w* [hath spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} it. 
\v 5 \w For all people| strong="H5971" \w* [will walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w every one| strong="H376" \w* \w in the name| strong="H8034" \w* \w of his god| strong="H430" \w*, [and we will walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the name| strong="H8034" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w our God| strong="H430" \w* \w for ever| strong="H5769" \w* \w and ever| strong="H5703" \w*. 
\v 6 \w In that day| strong="H3117" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*, [will I assemble]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [her that halteth]{strong=“H6760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and I will gather]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [her that is driven out]{strong=“H5080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, [and her that I have afflicted]{strong=“H7489” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}; 
\v 7 [And I will make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [her that halted]{strong=“H6760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w a remnant| strong="H7611" \w*, [and her that was cast far off]{strong=“H1972” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w a strong| strong="H6099" \w* \w nation| strong="H1471" \w*: and the \sc Lord\sc* [shall reign]{strong=“H4427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w over them in mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Zion| strong="H6726" \w* [from henceforth, even for]{strong=“H5704”} \w ever| strong="H5769" \w*. 
\p
\v 8 [And thou, O tower]{strong=“H4026”} [of the flock]{strong=“H4029 H5739” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8677”}, \w the strong hold| strong="H6076" \w* \w of the daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of Zion| strong="H6726" \w*, [unto thee shall it come]{strong=“H857” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w even the first| strong="H7223" \w* \w dominion| strong="H4475" \w*; \w the kingdom| strong="H4467" \w* [shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to the daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*. 
\v 9 [Now why dost thou cry]{strong=“H7321” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w out aloud| strong="H7452" \w*? is there \w no king| strong="H4428" \w* [in thee? is thy counsellor]{strong=“H3289” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [perished]{strong=“H6” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}? \w for pangs| strong="H2427" \w* [have taken]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [thee as a woman in travail]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\v 10 [Be in pain]{strong=“H2342” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [and labour to bring forth]{strong=“H1518” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \w O daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of Zion| strong="H6726" \w*, [like a woman in travail]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: [for now shalt thou go forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w out of the city| strong="H7151" \w*, [and thou shalt dwell]{strong=“H7931” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the field| strong="H7704" \w*, [and thou shalt go]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} even \w to Babylon| strong="H894" \w*; [there shalt thou be delivered]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}; there the \sc Lord\sc* [shall redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee from the hand| strong="H3709" \w* [of thine enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\p
\v 11 \w Now also many| strong="H7227" \w* \w nations| strong="H1471" \w* [are gathered]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [against thee, that say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [Let her be defiled]{strong=“H2610” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w and let our eye| strong="H5869" \w* [look]{strong=“H2372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w upon Zion| strong="H6726" \w*. 
\v 12 [But they know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w not the thoughts| strong="H4284" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, [neither understand]{strong=“H995” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w they his counsel| strong="H6098" \w*: [for he shall gather]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w them as the sheaves| strong="H5995" \w* \w into the floor| strong="H1637" \w*. 
\v 13 [Arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [and thresh]{strong=“H1758” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \w O daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of Zion| strong="H6726" \w*: [for I will make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thine horn| strong="H7161" \w* \w iron| strong="H1270" \w*, [and I will make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy hoofs| strong="H6541" \w* \w brass| strong="H5154" \w*: [and thou shalt beat in pieces]{strong=“H1854” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w many| strong="H7227" \w* \w people| strong="H5971" \w*: [and I will consecrate]{strong=“H2763” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w their gain| strong="H1215" \w* unto the \sc Lord\sc*, \w and their substance| strong="H2428" \w* \w unto the Lord| strong="H113" \w* \w of the whole earth| strong="H776" \w*. 
\c 5
\p 
\v 1 [Now gather]{strong=“H1413” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8704”} \w thyself in troops| strong="H1416" \w*, \w O daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w of troops| strong="H1416" \w*: [he hath laid]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w siege| strong="H4692" \w* [against us: they shall smite]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [the judge]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w with a rod| strong="H7626" \w* \w upon the cheek| strong="H3895" \w*. 
\v 2 [But thou, Beth-lehem]{strong=“H1035”} \w Ephratah| strong="H672" \w*, though \w thou be little| strong="H6810" \w* \w among the thousands| strong="H505" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, yet [out of thee shall he come forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto me that is [to be ruler]{strong=“H4910” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; \w whose goings forth| strong="H4163" \w* have been \w from of old| strong="H6924" \w*, [from everlasting]{strong=“H5769 H3117”}.\f + \fr 5:2 \ft everlasting: Heb. the days of eternity \f* 
\v 3 [Therefore will he give them up]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w until the time| strong="H6256" \w* that [she which travaileth]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [hath brought forth]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: \w then the remnant| strong="H3499" \w* \w of his brethren| strong="H251" \w* [shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\p
\v 4 [And he shall stand]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [and feed]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the strength| strong="H5797" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w in the majesty| strong="H1347" \w* \w of the name| strong="H8034" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w his God| strong="H430" \w*; [and they shall abide]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [for now shall he be great]{strong=“H1431” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the ends| strong="H657" \w* \w of the earth| strong="H776" \w*.\f + \fr 5:4 \ft feed: or, rule \f* 
\v 5 And this man \w shall be the peace| strong="H7965" \w*, \w when the Assyrian| strong="H804" \w* [shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into our land| strong="H776" \w*: [and when he shall tread]{strong=“H1869” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in our palaces| strong="H759" \w*, [then shall we raise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w against him seven| strong="H7651" \w* [shepherds]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w and eight| strong="H8083" \w* \w principal| strong="H5257" \w* \w men| strong="H120" \w*.\f + \fr 5:5 \ft principal: Heb. princes of \f* 
\v 6 [And they shall waste]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Assyria| strong="H804" \w* \w with the sword| strong="H2719" \w*, \w and the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Nimrod| strong="H5248" \w* \w in the entrances| strong="H6607" \w* [thereof: thus shall he deliver]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} us \w from the Assyrian| strong="H804" \w*, [when he cometh]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into our land| strong="H776" \w*, [and when he treadeth]{strong=“H1869” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w within our borders| strong="H1366" \w*.\f + \fr 5:6 \ft waste: Heb. eat up \f* \f + \fr 5:6 \ft in the…: or, with her own naked swords \f* 
\p
\v 7 \w And the remnant| strong="H7611" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* \w shall be in the midst| strong="H7130" \w* \w of many| strong="H7227" \w* \w people| strong="H5971" \w* \w as a dew| strong="H2919" \w* from the \sc Lord\sc*, \w as the showers| strong="H7241" \w* \w upon the grass| strong="H6212" \w*, [that tarrieth]{strong=“H6960” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w not for man| strong="H376" \w*, [nor waiteth]{strong=“H3176” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w for the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of men| strong="H120" \w*. 
\p
\v 8 \w And the remnant| strong="H7611" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* \w shall be among the Gentiles| strong="H1471" \w* \w in the midst| strong="H7130" \w* \w of many| strong="H7227" \w* \w people| strong="H5971" \w* \w as a lion| strong="H738" \w* \w among the beasts| strong="H929" \w* \w of the forest| strong="H3293" \w*, \w as a young lion| strong="H3715" \w* \w among the flocks| strong="H5739" \w* \w of sheep| strong="H6629" \w*: [who, if he go through]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [both treadeth down]{strong=“H7429” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and teareth in pieces]{strong=“H2963” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and none can deliver]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}.\f + \fr 5:8 \ft sheep: or, goats \f* 
\v 9 \w Thine hand| strong="H3027" \w* [shall be lifted up]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w upon thine adversaries| strong="H6862" \w*, [and all thine enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall be cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}. 
\v 10 \w And it shall come to pass in that day| strong="H3117" \w*, [saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*, [that I will cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w thy horses| strong="H5483" \w* \w out of the midst| strong="H7130" \w* [of thee, and I will destroy]{strong=“H6” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w thy chariots| strong="H4818" \w*: 
\v 11 [And I will cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [the cities]{strong=“H5892 H6145” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8676”} \w of thy land| strong="H776" \w*, [and throw down]{strong=“H2040” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w all thy strong holds| strong="H4013" \w*: 
\v 12 [And I will cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w witchcrafts| strong="H3785" \w* \w out of thine hand| strong="H3027" \w*; and thou shalt have no more [soothsayers]{strong=“H6049” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8781”}: 
\v 13 \w Thy graven images| strong="H6456" \w* [also will I cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, \w and thy standing images| strong="H4676" \w* \w out of the midst| strong="H7130" \w* [of thee; and thou shalt no more worship]{strong=“H7812” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} \w the work| strong="H4639" \w* \w of thine hands| strong="H3027" \w*.\f + \fr 5:13 \ft standing…: or, statues \f* 
\v 14 [And I will pluck up]{strong=“H5428” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thy groves| strong="H842" \w* \w out of the midst| strong="H7130" \w* [of thee: so will I destroy]{strong=“H8045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [thy cities]{strong=“H5892 H6145” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8676”}.\f + \fr 5:14 \ft cities: or, enemies \f* 
\v 15 [And I will execute]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w vengeance| strong="H5359" \w* \w in anger| strong="H639" \w* \w and fury| strong="H2534" \w* \w upon the heathen| strong="H1471" \w*, [such as they have not heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}.
\c 6
\p 
\v 1 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} ye now what the \sc Lord\sc* [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}; [Arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [contend]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thou before the mountains| strong="H2022" \w*, \w and let the hills| strong="H1389" \w* [hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy voice| strong="H6963" \w*.\f + \fr 6:1 \ft before: or, with \f* 
\v 2 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [ye, O mountains]{strong=“H2022”}, the \sc Lord\sc*’S \w controversy| strong="H7379" \w*, \w and ye strong| strong="H386" \w* \w foundations| strong="H4146" \w* \w of the earth| strong="H776" \w*: for the \sc Lord\sc* \w hath a controversy| strong="H7379" \w* \w with his people| strong="H5971" \w*, [and he will plead]{strong=“H3198” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} \w with Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\v 3 \w O my people| strong="H5971" \w*, [what have I done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [unto thee? and wherein have I wearied]{strong=“H3811” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [thee? testify]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} against me. 
\v 4 [For I brought thee up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w out of the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [and redeemed]{strong=“H6299” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thee out of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of servants| strong="H5650" \w*; [and I sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w thee Moses| strong="H4872" \w*, \w Aaron| strong="H175" \w*, \w and Miriam| strong="H4813" \w*. 
\v 5 \w O my people| strong="H5971" \w*, [remember]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w now what Balak| strong="H1111" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Moab| strong="H4124" \w* [consulted]{strong=“H3289” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and what Balaam| strong="H1109" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Beor| strong="H1160" \w* [answered]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w him from Shittim| strong="H7851" \w* \w unto Gilgal| strong="H1537" \w*; [that ye may know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the righteousness| strong="H6666" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\p
\v 6 [Wherewith shall I come before]{strong=“H6923” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} the \sc Lord\sc*, and [bow]{strong=“H3721” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w myself before the high| strong="H4791" \w* \w God| strong="H430" \w*? [shall I come before]{strong=“H6923” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w him with burnt offerings| strong="H5930" \w*, \w with calves| strong="H5695" \w* \w of a year| strong="H8141" \w* \w old| strong="H1121" \w*?\f + \fr 6:6 \ft of a…: Heb. sons of a year? \f* 
\v 7 Will the \sc Lord\sc* [be pleased]{strong=“H7521” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w with thousands| strong="H505" \w* \w of rams| strong="H352" \w*, or \w with ten thousands| strong="H7233" \w* \w of rivers| strong="H5158" \w* \w of oil| strong="H8081" \w*? [shall I give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my firstborn| strong="H1060" \w* for \w my transgression| strong="H6588" \w*, \w the fruit| strong="H6529" \w* \w of my body| strong="H990" \w* for \w the sin| strong="H2403" \w* \w of my soul| strong="H5315" \w*?\f + \fr 6:7 \ft body: Heb. belly \f* 
\v 8 [He hath shewed]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [thee, O man]{strong=“H120”}, what is \w good| strong="H2896" \w*; and what doth the \sc Lord\sc* [require]{strong=“H1875” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [of thee, but to do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w justly| strong="H4941" \w*, \w and to love| strong="H160" \w* \w mercy| strong="H2617" \w*, [and to walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [humbly]{strong=“H6800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w with thy God| strong="H430" \w*?\f + \fr 6:8 \ft walk…: Heb. humble thyself to walk \f* 
\p
\v 9 The \sc Lord\sc*’S \w voice| strong="H6963" \w* [crieth]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the city| strong="H5892" \w*, and the man of \w wisdom| strong="H8454" \w* [shall see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy name| strong="H8034" \w*: [hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w ye the rod| strong="H4294" \w*, [and who hath appointed]{strong=“H3259” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} it.\f + \fr 6:9 \ft the man…: or, thy name shall see that which is \f* 
\p
\v 10 \w Are there| strong="H786" \w* \w yet the treasures| strong="H214" \w* [of wickedness]{strong=“H376 H7562” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8676”} \w in the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of the wicked| strong="H7563" \w*, \w and the scant| strong="H7332" \w* \w measure| strong="H374" \w* that is [abominable]{strong=“H2194” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}?\f + \fr 6:10 \ft Are…: or, Is there yet unto every man an house of the, etc \f* \f + \fr 6:10 \ft scant…: Heb. measure of leanness \f* 
\v 11 Shall I count them [pure]{strong=“H2135” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w with the wicked| strong="H7562" \w* \w balances| strong="H3976" \w*, \w and with the bag| strong="H3599" \w* \w of deceitful| strong="H4820" \w* \w weights| strong="H68" \w*?\f + \fr 6:11 \ft count…: or, be pure with, etc \f* 
\v 12 \w For the rich men| strong="H6223" \w* [thereof are full]{strong=“H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w of violence| strong="H2555" \w*, [and the inhabitants]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [thereof have spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w lies| strong="H8267" \w*, \w and their tongue| strong="H3956" \w* is \w deceitful| strong="H7423" \w* \w in their mouth| strong="H6310" \w*. 
\v 13 Therefore also will I make thee [sick]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [in smiting]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} thee, in making thee [desolate]{strong=“H8074” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w because of thy sins| strong="H2403" \w*. 
\v 14 [Thou shalt eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [but not be satisfied]{strong=“H7646” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; \w and thy casting down| strong="H3445" \w* shall be \w in the midst| strong="H7130" \w* [of thee; and thou shalt take hold]{strong=“H5253” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [but shalt not deliver]{strong=“H6403” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}; and that [which thou deliverest]{strong=“H6403” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [will I give up]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the sword| strong="H2719" \w*. 
\v 15 [Thou shalt sow]{strong=“H2232” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [but thou shalt not reap]{strong=“H7114” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [thou shalt tread]{strong=“H1869” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the olives| strong="H2132" \w*, [but thou shalt not anoint]{strong=“H5480” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee with oil| strong="H8081" \w*; \w and sweet wine| strong="H8492" \w*, [but shalt not drink]{strong=“H8354” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w wine| strong="H3196" \w*. 
\p
\v 16 \w For the statutes| strong="H2708" \w* \w of Omri| strong="H6018" \w* [are kept]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”}, \w and all the works| strong="H4639" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Ahab| strong="H256" \w*, [and ye walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in their counsels| strong="H4156" \w*; [that I should make]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w thee a desolation| strong="H8047" \w*, [and the inhabitants]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w thereof an hissing| strong="H8322" \w*: [therefore ye shall bear]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the reproach| strong="H2781" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*.\f + \fr 6:16 \ft For the…: or, For he doth much keep the, etc \f* \f + \fr 6:16 \ft desolation: or, astonishment \f*
\c 7
\p 
\v 1 \w Woe| strong="H480" \w* [is me! for I am as when they have gathered]{strong=“H625”} \w the summer fruits| strong="H7019" \w*, \w as the grapegleanings| strong="H5955" \w* \w of the vintage| strong="H1210" \w*: there is \w no cluster| strong="H811" \w* [to eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: \w my soul| strong="H5315" \w* [desired]{strong=“H183” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the firstripe fruit| strong="H1063" \w*.\f + \fr 7:1 \ft when…: Heb. the gatherings of summer \f* 
\v 2 \w The good| strong="H2623" \w* man [is perished]{strong=“H6” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w out of the earth| strong="H776" \w*: and there is \w none upright| strong="H3477" \w* \w among men| strong="H120" \w*: [they all lie in wait]{strong=“H693” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for blood| strong="H1818" \w*; [they hunt]{strong=“H6679” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w every man| strong="H376" \w* \w his brother| strong="H251" \w* \w with a net| strong="H2764" \w*.\f + \fr 7:2 \ft good: or, godly, or, merciful \f* 
\p
\v 3 \w That they may do evil| strong="H7451" \w* \w with both hands| strong="H3709" \w* [earnestly]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}, \w the prince| strong="H8269" \w* [asketh]{strong=“H7592” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and the judge]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} asketh \w for a reward| strong="H7966" \w*; \w and the great| strong="H1419" \w* man, [he uttereth]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w his mischievous| strong="H1942" \w* \w desire| strong="H5315" \w*: [so they wrap it up]{strong=“H5686” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}.\f + \fr 7:3 \ft his…: Heb. the mischief of his soul \f* 
\v 4 \w The best| strong="H2896" \w* of them is \w as a brier| strong="H2312" \w*: \w the most upright| strong="H3477" \w* is sharper \w than a thorn hedge| strong="H4534" \w*: \w the day| strong="H3117" \w* [of thy watchmen]{strong=“H6822” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} and \w thy visitation| strong="H6486" \w* [cometh]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w now shall be their perplexity| strong="H3998" \w*. 
\p
\v 5 [Trust]{strong=“H539” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w ye not in a friend| strong="H7453" \w*, [put ye not confidence]{strong=“H982” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in a guide| strong="H441" \w*: [keep]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the doors| strong="H6607" \w* \w of thy mouth| strong="H6310" \w* [from her that lieth]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in thy bosom| strong="H2436" \w*. 
\v 6 \w For the son| strong="H1121" \w* [dishonoureth]{strong=“H5034” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w the father| strong="H1" \w*, \w the daughter| strong="H1323" \w* [riseth up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w against her mother| strong="H517" \w*, \w the daughter in law| strong="H3618" \w* \w against her mother in law| strong="H2545" \w*; [a man’s]{strong=“H376”} [enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} are \w the men| strong="H582" \w* \w of his own house| strong="H1004" \w*. 
\p
\v 7 [Therefore I will look]{strong=“H6822” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*; [I will wait]{strong=“H3176” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w for the God| strong="H430" \w* \w of my salvation| strong="H3468" \w*: \w my God| strong="H430" \w* [will hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} me. 
\p
\v 8 [Rejoice]{strong=“H8055” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [not against me, O mine enemy]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: [when I fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [I shall arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; [when I sit]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in darkness| strong="H2822" \w*, the \sc Lord\sc* shall be \w a light| strong="H216" \w* unto me. 
\v 9 [I will bear]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the indignation| strong="H2197" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, [because I have sinned]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [against him, until he plead]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my cause| strong="H7379" \w*, [and execute]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w judgment| strong="H4941" \w* [for me: he will bring me forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w to the light| strong="H216" \w*, and [I shall behold]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his righteousness| strong="H6666" \w*. 
\v 10 Then she that is [mine enemy]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it, \w and shame| strong="H955" \w* [shall cover]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [her which said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} unto me, Where is the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w*? \w mine eyes| strong="H5869" \w* [shall behold]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [her: now shall she be trodden down]{strong=“H4823”} \w as the mire| strong="H2916" \w* \w of the streets| strong="H2351" \w*.\f + \fr 7:10 \ft Then…: or, And thou wilt see her that is mine enemy, and cover her with shame \f* \f + \fr 7:10 \ft shall she…: Heb. she shall be for a treading down \f* 
\v 11 In \w the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w that thy walls| strong="H1447" \w* [are to be built]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, in \w that day| strong="H3117" \w* \w shall the decree| strong="H2706" \w* [be far removed]{strong=“H7368” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 12 In \w that day| strong="H3117" \w* also [he shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w even to thee from Assyria| strong="H804" \w*, and from \w the fortified| strong="H4693" \w* \w cities| strong="H5892" \w*, \w and from the fortress| strong="H4693" \w* \w even to the river| strong="H5104" \w*, \w and from sea| strong="H3220" \w* \w to sea| strong="H3220" \w*, and from \w mountain| strong="H2022" \w* \w to mountain| strong="H2022" \w*.\f + \fr 7:12 \ft and from the fortified cities: or, even to the fortified cities \f* 
\v 13 \w Notwithstanding the land| strong="H776" \w* \w shall be desolate| strong="H8077" \w* [because of them that dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [therein, for the fruit]{strong=“H6529”} \w of their doings| strong="H4611" \w*.\f + \fr 7:13 \ft Notwithstanding: or, After that it hath been \f* 
\p
\v 14 [Feed]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thy people| strong="H5971" \w* \w with thy rod| strong="H7626" \w*, \w the flock| strong="H6629" \w* \w of thine heritage| strong="H5159" \w*, [which dwell]{strong=“H7931” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w solitarily| strong="H910" \w* in \w the wood| strong="H3293" \w*, \w in the midst| strong="H8432" \w* \w of Carmel| strong="H3760" \w*: [let them feed]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} in \w Bashan| strong="H1316" \w* \w and Gilead| strong="H1568" \w*, \w as in the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of old| strong="H5769" \w*.\f + \fr 7:14 \ft Feed: or, Rule \f* 
\v 15 \w According to the days| strong="H3117" \w* [of thy coming]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w out of the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w* [will I shew]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [unto him marvellous]{strong=“H6381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} things. 
\p
\v 16 \w The nations| strong="H1471" \w* [shall see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and be confounded]{strong=“H954” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w at all their might| strong="H1369" \w*: [they shall lay]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} their \w hand| strong="H3027" \w* upon their \w mouth| strong="H6310" \w*, \w their ears| strong="H241" \w* [shall be deaf]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 17 [They shall lick]{strong=“H3897” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the dust| strong="H6083" \w* \w like a serpent| strong="H5175" \w*, [they shall move]{strong=“H7264” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w out of their holes| strong="H4526" \w* [like worms]{strong=“H2119” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w of the earth| strong="H776" \w*: [they shall be afraid]{strong=“H6342” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} of the \sc Lord\sc* \w our God| strong="H430" \w*, [and shall fear]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} because of thee.\f + \fr 7:17 \ft worms: or, creeping things \f* 
\v 18 Who is \w a God| strong="H410" \w* [like unto thee, that pardoneth]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*, [and passeth by]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the transgression| strong="H6588" \w* \w of the remnant| strong="H7611" \w* \w of his heritage| strong="H5159" \w*? [he retaineth]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w not his anger| strong="H639" \w* \w for ever| strong="H5703" \w*, [because he delighteth]{strong=“H2654” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} in \w mercy| strong="H2617" \w*. 
\v 19 [He will turn again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [he will have compassion]{strong=“H7355” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [upon us; he will subdue]{strong=“H3533” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w our iniquities| strong="H5771" \w*; [and thou wilt cast]{strong=“H7993” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w all their sins| strong="H2403" \w* \w into the depths| strong="H4688" \w* \w of the sea| strong="H3220" \w*. 
\v 20 [Thou wilt perform]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the truth| strong="H571" \w* \w to Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, and \w the mercy| strong="H2617" \w* \w to Abraham| strong="H85" \w*, [which thou hast sworn]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w unto our fathers| strong="H1" \w* \w from the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of old| strong="H6924" \w*. 
